title: "ControlSift: Domain Adaptation of Gemma 3 for Cybersecurity Control-Evidence Assessment"
authors:
  - name: "ControlSift Contributors"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-08"
url: "https://github.com/controlsift/controlsift"
abstract: >-
  Applied AI research investigating whether parameter-efficient fine-tuning
  (QLoRA) improves a small language model's ability to distinguish strong
  cybersecurity control evidence from incomplete, irrelevant, or contradictory artifacts.
keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - evidence evaluation
  - QLoRA
  - Gemma
  - model assurance
